  "description": "<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">It&rsquo;s A Finished Work Is a leading player in luxury Christian footwear. Bringing you the latest in perfectly handcrafted Italian shoes. A combination of luxury style and comfort designed for shoe lovers who are not ashamed to walk with Jesus! We also have a collection of inspirational hoodies &amp; t-shirts. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">Our unique selling point is we believe in giving back to the community and making a positive impact. A portion of the proceeds from every sale of our Christian Shoes goes towards supporting charitable organizations and initiatives that align with Christian values, allowing you to contribute to causes that matter.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">Our hashtags:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">#itsafinishedwork #walkingwithjesus #savingsouls #christianclothingbrand #christianapparel #christianclothing </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">Payment Terms:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">Affiliates will earn a 10% commission on all sales generated through their unique affiliate link. Payments will be made 45 days after purchase to allow for any returned items via PayPal, with a minimum payout threshold of &pound;50</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px;\">Other Information:</span></p>